        "title": "Pyramid 2000",
        "extract": "Pyramid 2000 is an interactive fiction game. The game is an altered version of Colossal Cave that takes advantage of an Egyptian setting, re-theming some of the locations, objects, and puzzles. For instance, the \"little bird\" from Adventure is now a \"bird statue\" and the \"clam\" is a \"sarcophagus.\"",
